  |
3 | extern blocking fun slow(x: i64): i64;
  |                     ---- first declared here
4 | extern "slow" fun slow_plain(x: i64): i64;
  |                   ^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: every declaration of a C function must agree on `blocking`

